[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0010","text":"……嗯\n想点什么喜欢的，点了吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0020","text":"啊，谢谢您\n啊哈哈，点什么好呢——……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0030","text":"嗯——…………\n————啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0040","text":"…………？\n决定好了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0050","text":"啊，没有……！\n只是看到有刨冰"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0060","text":"冰冰凉凉的，而且就是水嘛！\n这样的话美琴小姐也应该，多少能……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0070","text":"说的也是\n……那就"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0080","text":"点这个吧\n难得制作人说要请客"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0090","text":"好的\n那就让您请客吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_01_0100","text":"……刨冰什么的，\n来东京之后可能还是第一次吃"}]
